        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions WST150SMTFBR, Offset Brass Selkirk Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA nice, simple pull, the Selkirk Brass Door Pull features a slightly modern look that makes it a good choice for both residential and commercial spaces. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. The Selkirk Handle is made from brass and has offset mounts. It is available in a huge selection of finishes and can be ordered in 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Selkirk Offset Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SLK01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262336\"><b>First Impressions WST150SMTFBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>WST150018SMTFBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-4/25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST150024SMTFBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-4/25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST150036SMTFBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-4/25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
