                "title": "Selkirk Brass Door Pull",
                "description": "A nice, simple pull, the Selkirk Brass Door Pull features a slightly modern look that makes it a good choice for both residential and commercial spaces. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. The Selkirk Handle is made from brass and has offset mounts. It is available in a huge selection of finishes and can be ordered in 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.",
